        <mxCell id="cmp" value="Recovery comparison for post-COMMIT crash:&#xa;  Without outbox:  sweeper guesses from age heuristic (updated_at &lt; now()-Ns) → ~90s recovery, requires per-phase threshold tuning, gaps exist in current plan&#xa;  With outbox:     relay detects published_at IS NULL → ~500ms recovery, no tuning, uniform across all workers&#xa;&#xa;Probability at 1M jobs/month: ~3–6 events/month (0.1–0.2/day).  Each = silent stuck job without any recovery mechanism." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="760" height="82" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
